{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果首款摺疊屏手機iPhone Duo在多個主要市場獲得的預訂量超過了公司原先預期。這一積極表現不僅為蘋果帶來利好，也讓顯示晶片產業鏈對摺疊屏設備市場前景更為樂觀。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583484.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:43:51.775700+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:34:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.572122+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.572122+00:00","content_hash":"c25c9f902951822ba003ba3d65fbceed67593170ec6124ab14542da442c8f916","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}